msgstr "Active - only the Owner can access it"

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:823
msgid ""
"Aktifkan Mode Perbaikan? Kasir, dapur, dan pelayan tidak akan bisa "
"memakai aplikasi sampai kamu matikan lagi."
msgstr ""
"Turn on Maintenance Mode? Kasir, dapur, and pelayan accounts won't be "
"able to use the app until you turn it off again."

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:827
msgid "Matikan Mode Perbaikan"
msgstr "Turn Off Maintenance Mode"

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:831
msgid "Aktifkan Mode Perbaikan"
msgstr "Turn On Maintenance Mode"

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:838
msgid ""
"Aktifkan saat sedang ada perbaikan kode di server produksi. Selama aktif,"
" semua pengguna lain (kasir, dapur, pelayan, dan siapa pun yang belum "
"login) akan melihat halaman \"Sedang Dalam Perbaikan\", sementara akun "
"Owner tetap bisa memakai aplikasi seperti biasa untuk menguji perubahan "
"sebelum dinyalakan lagi ke semua orang."
msgstr ""
"Turn this on when there's a code fix in progress on the production "
"server. While active, every other user (kasir, dapur, pelayan, and anyone"
" not logged in) will see the \"Under Maintenance\" page, while the Owner "
"account can keep using the app as usual to test the changes before "
"turning it back on for everyone."

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:846
#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:873
