msgstr "Factory Reset PIN"

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:860
msgid "Kunci Reset"
msgstr "Lock Reset"

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:866
msgid ""
"Kosongkan kategori, menu, bahan baku, meja, lantai, riwayat pesanan, dan "
"kembalikan Pengaturan Toko ke kondisi kosong - KECUALI menu Pengguna, "
"semua akun staf beserta role & izinnya tetap utuh. Tindakan ini permanen "
"dan tidak bisa dibatalkan."
msgstr ""
"Clears categories, menu items, ingredients, tables, floors, order "
"history, and resets Store Settings back to empty - EXCEPT the Users menu,"
" all staff accounts along with their role & permissions stay intact. This"
" action is permanent and cannot be undone."

#: app/templates/staff/settings_admin.html:870
msgid ""
"YAKIN reset ke mode pabrik? Semua data toko akan hilang permanen, kecuali"
" daftar pengguna. Tindakan ini TIDAK BISA dibatalkan."
msgstr ""
"Are you SURE you want to factory reset? All store data will be lost "
"permanently, except the user list. This action CANNOT be undone."

